(7298105, 1138221, 25024, '<td valign="top">What a great macro with all those very vivid colours and your DOF works extremely well. If I had one minor criticism is that it is a little central, I think it would lend itself to placement slightly to the right? Anyway, it is still one of my highest scorers, I wish you well with it.</td>', 'What a great macro with all those very vivid colours and your DOF works extremely well. If I had one minor criticism is that it is a little central, I think it would lend itself to placement slightly to the right? Anyway, it is still one of my highest scorers, I wish you well with it.', '2015-01-03 06:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298106, 1137519, 25024, '<td valign="top">Another of two great macros in this challenge you no doubt know which is the other! This works so very well in terms of DOF I love the sharp focus on the eyes and the receding soft focus curve of the leaf and also the reflections in that water drop below. It is one of my highest scorers and will undoubtedly do well, good luck</td>', 'Another of two great macros in this challenge you no doubt know which is the other! This works so very well in terms of DOF I love the sharp focus on the eyes and the receding soft focus curve of the leaf and also the reflections in that water drop below. It is one of my highest scorers and will undoubtedly do well, good luck', '2015-01-03 06:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298107, 1137008, 25024, '<td valign="top">Very creatively done, I love your chosen focus and shallow DOF, it works so well. As I look at it I''m wondering if a slight shift in composition to the lower right reducing the empty area and taking the centre more off-centre would improve it? It still remains one of my highest scorers and should do well, good luck</td>', 'Very creatively done, I love your chosen focus and shallow DOF, it works so well. As I look at it I''m wondering if a slight shift in composition to the lower right reducing the empty area and taking the centre more off-centre would improve it? It still remains one of my highest scorers and should do well, good luck', '2015-01-03 06:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298108, 1137889, 25024, '<td valign="top">A lovely nature study from presumably warmer climes than I am in here! I like the composition and timing and dark background. One of my highest scorers, I hope you do well with it.</td>', 'A lovely nature study from presumably warmer climes than I am in here! I like the composition and timing and dark background. One of my highest scorers, I hope you do well with it.', '2015-01-03 06:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298109, 1137976, 25024, '<td valign="top">I am presuming this is someone''s excellent artwork? Whilst it is a good reproduction I would have liked to see something of your own adding another element to the image, i.e.., someone interacting with it?</td>', 'I am presuming this is someone''s excellent artwork? Whilst it is a good reproduction I would have liked to see something of your own adding another element to the image, i.e.., someone interacting with it?', '2015-01-03 06:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
