(7298111, 1138251, 25024, '<td valign="top">I must obviously be missing something here but I am not able to understand what it is or what your intention is, and if the title is just a spelling mistake, sorry</td>', 'I must obviously be missing something here but I am not able to understand what it is or what your intention is, and if the title is just a spelling mistake, sorry', '2015-01-03 06:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298112, 1136717, 25024, '<td valign="top">Oh, sloping seas! In this type of image where it is such a crucial element to the overall image the horizon really should be levelled. <br/>I am left a little puzzled about the title, I can see a couple of objects in the water, possibly people but they are so insignificant that they only serve to distract. <br/>The foreground would have benefited from lightening up and the sign needs cropping out. <br/>I hope you don''t take offence at my critique my intentions are to help you.</td>', 'Oh, sloping seas! In this type of image where it is such a crucial element to the overall image the horizon really should be levelled. I am left a little puzzled about the title, I can see a couple of objects in the water, possibly people but they are so insignificant that they only serve to distract. The foreground would have benefited from lightening up and the sign needs cropping out. I hope you don''t take offence at my critique my intentions are to help you.', '2015-01-03 06:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
