(7299848, 1138237, 156466, '<td valign="top">That break in the leaves just doesn''t look right - like some very bad overprocessing (though I suspect it isn''t overprocessed at all).</td>', 'That break in the leaves just doesn''t look right - like some very bad overprocessing (though I suspect it isn''t overprocessed at all).', '2015-01-07 14:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299850, 1138215, 156466, '<td valign="top">That little bit of pink to the nose - not a fan of it.  Otherwise lovely.</td>', 'That little bit of pink to the nose - not a fan of it.  Otherwise lovely.', '2015-01-07 14:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299851, 1138032, 156466, '<td valign="top">highlights are just to muted.</td>', 'highlights are just to muted.', '2015-01-07 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299856, 1138201, 156466, '<td valign="top">The dark foreground and short crop make this feel off. Wave and misty shadows are gorgeous, but it just doesn''t make it past "really good" for me.</td>', 'The dark foreground and short crop make this feel off. Wave and misty shadows are gorgeous, but it just doesn''t make it past "really good" for me.', '2015-01-07 14:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299857, 1138120, 176157, '<td valign="top">That''s beautiful.</td>', 'That''s beautiful.', '2015-01-07 14:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299859, 1137112, 176157, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2015-01-07 14:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299865, 1136642, 156466, '<td valign="top">Is this flipped vertically?  I am so enamored with the center part, but the further left I go the more it loses me.  It makes me want to play with cropping it a thousand ways.  But that doesn''t mean it''s not lovely.</td>', 'Is this flipped vertically?  I am so enamored with the center part, but the further left I go the more it loses me.  It makes me want to play with cropping it a thousand ways.  But that doesn''t mean it''s not lovely.', '2015-01-07 14:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299868, 1136800, 156466, '<td valign="top">Feels overprocessed.</td>', 'Feels overprocessed.', '2015-01-07 14:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299871, 1137726, 156466, '<td valign="top">Gap above the branch is distracting.  Tighter crop improves this nice capture.</td>', 'Gap above the branch is distracting.  Tighter crop improves this nice capture.', '2015-01-07 14:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299873, 1137976, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would have loved this if you could pulled "Verne" back into the realms of normalcy.  The processing works everywhere else for me, but not on him.</td>', 'Would have loved this if you could pulled "Verne" back into the realms of normalcy.  The processing works everywhere else for me, but not on him.', '2015-01-07 14:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299877, 1137945, 156466, '<td valign="top">Horizon is crooked. Shame.</td>', 'Horizon is crooked. Shame.', '2015-01-07 14:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299881, 1136919, 156466, '<td valign="top">I can never get them to pose for me.  Well captured.</td>', 'I can never get them to pose for me.  Well captured.', '2015-01-07 14:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299883, 1138197, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but the CA around the body is distracting.</td>', 'Nice capture but the CA around the body is distracting.', '2015-01-07 14:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299885, 1138008, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not big on the added tilt-shift (or is it iris?) blur.  Great blues on the pipes in the center.</td>', 'Not big on the added tilt-shift (or is it iris?) blur.  Great blues on the pipes in the center.', '2015-01-07 14:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299887, 1137583, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture, but he''s lost a little too much into the background.  Some selective darkening and/or blurring here would really bring him out.</td>', 'Lovely capture, but he''s lost a little too much into the background.  Some selective darkening and/or blurring here would really bring him out.', '2015-01-07 14:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299891, 1138120, 156466, '<td valign="top">Feels just a touch back-focused.</td>', 'Feels just a touch back-focused.', '2015-01-07 14:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299893, 1138147, 156466, '<td valign="top">Wow.  If only that one bright white in the reflection wasn''t there.  Otherwise stunning.</td>', 'Wow.  If only that one bright white in the reflection wasn''t there.  Otherwise stunning.', '2015-01-07 14:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299894, 1137866, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I suspect this might have done better in the candid portrait than it will here.</td>', 'Great capture.  I suspect this might have done better in the candid portrait than it will here.', '2015-01-07 14:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299895, 1138039, 156466, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this.  Outstanding.</td>', 'Absolutely love this.  Outstanding.', '2015-01-07 14:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299897, 1137584, 156466, '<td valign="top">This is very cool, and likely tells a heck of a story, but it needs some perspective correction as the building lines distract from an otherwise wonderful capture.</td>', 'This is very cool, and likely tells a heck of a story, but it needs some perspective correction as the building lines distract from an otherwise wonderful capture.', '2015-01-07 14:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299899, 1138126, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not big on the trees framing this, particularly with the gap to the left.  Were the dead branches not there I think there''s something nice in the mix of the tree, needles and steeple, but there''s just too much noise on the edges here.</td>', 'Not big on the trees framing this, particularly with the gap to the left.  Were the dead branches not there I think there''s something nice in the mix of the tree, needles and steeple, but there''s just too much noise on the edges here.', '2015-01-07 14:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299900, 1138243, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nicely processed.  I just find there to be too much extra off to the left.  Perhaps a narrower crop shaving off the last bare vertical on the left side?</td>', 'Nicely processed.  I just find there to be too much extra off to the left.  Perhaps a narrower crop shaving off the last bare vertical on the left side?', '2015-01-07 14:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299901, 1136919, 176157, '<td valign="top">How did you get him to pose?</td>', 'How did you get him to pose?', '2015-01-07 14:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299902, 1138107, 177322, '<td valign="top">Dynamic POV. And, although the leading lines are ultra-centered, it is an effective technique for this shot. Well done.</td>', 'Dynamic POV. And, although the leading lines are ultra-centered, it is an effective technique for this shot. Well done.', '2015-01-07 14:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299903, 1138079, 176157, '<td valign="top">Where is this place?</td>', 'Where is this place?', '2015-01-07 14:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7299905, 1138031, 176157, '<td valign="top">I read about this:  "Sheep gangs"</td>', 'I read about this:  "Sheep gangs"', '2015-01-07 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
