(7300127, 1138201, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sacredspirit:</b></div><hr/><i> I hate the border, I mean really, really don''t like it, but that said you still are getting a 10 from me.  Great photo, all the way.  The border is so insignificant to the beauty of the shot I can''t take a point away for that.  Maybe if I could take away .05 of a point I would, not an option, so again I say great job.  Beautiful. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Totally agree with this, the border was not pleasant... gave you a 7 bc of it, would''ve been higher without it, but I felt like you trapped the ocean in a frame and the waves had nowhere to go.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon anyways!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-01-08 02:48:45.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by sacredspirit: I hate the border, I mean really, really don''t like it, but that said you still are getting a 10 from me.  Great photo, all the way.  The border is so insignificant to the beauty of the shot I can''t take a point away for that.  Maybe if I could take away .05 of a point I would, not an option, so again I say great job.  Beautiful.   Totally agree with this, the border was not pleasant... gave you a 7 bc of it, would''ve been higher without it, but I felt like you trapped the ocean in a frame and the waves had nowhere to go. Congrats on the ribbon anyways!', '2015-01-08 02:47:02.000000', '2015-01-08 02:48:45.000000', 0),
