(7300139, 1137915, 117474, '<td valign="top">Technically 66 votes below the average, and only 27 below the mode :-)<br/> <br/>I''ll give my reason for voting below your average though: I find images like this boring. Having looked at it once I would learn nothing new from it on a second, or third viewing. I simply cannot justify giving high votes for images I deem as such.</td>', 'Technically 66 votes below the average, and only 27 below the mode :-) I''ll give my reason for voting below your average though: I find images like this boring. Having looked at it once I would learn nothing new from it on a second, or third viewing. I simply cannot justify giving high votes for images I deem as such.', '2015-01-08 04:43:34.000000', NULL, 0),
