(7300146, 1137696, 159196, '<td valign="top">Just stunning, this was my favorite, although I didn''t comment - congrats!</td>', 'Just stunning, this was my favorite, although I didn''t comment - congrats!', '2015-01-08 07:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7300147, 1138201, 159196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful - congrats!', '2015-01-08 07:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7300148, 1137915, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NiallOTuama:</b></div><hr/><i> Technically 66 votes below the average, and only 27 below the mode :-)<br/> <br/>I''ll give my reason for voting below your average though: I find images like this boring. Having looked at it once I would learn nothing new from it on a second, or third viewing. I simply cannot justify giving high votes for images I deem as such. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments.  There is a lot for you to learn from this imagenarrow depth of field, asymmetrical composition, natural lighting, white balance, selective focus, eye catch glint, dynamic range, control of shadow and highlight details to name a few.  However, if you feel this is just too boring, you must live in a different world than mine.  I can''t help you.  I can''t help the "66 votes below the average".  It is what it is.  There is nothing new under the sun.  Cynicism and hypocrisy about good photography is what is wrong with DPC.</td>', 'Originally posted by NiallOTuama: Technically 66 votes below the average, and only 27 below the mode :-) I''ll give my reason for voting below your average though: I find images like this boring. Having looked at it once I would learn nothing new from it on a second, or third viewing. I simply cannot justify giving high votes for images I deem as such.   Thanks for your comments.  There is a lot for you to learn from this imagenarrow depth of field, asymmetrical composition, natural lighting, white balance, selective focus, eye catch glint, dynamic range, control of shadow and highlight details to name a few.  However, if you feel this is just too boring, you must live in a different world than mine.  I can''t help you.  I can''t help the "66 votes below the average".  It is what it is.  There is nothing new under the sun.  Cynicism and hypocrisy about good photography is what is wrong with DPC.', '2015-01-08 08:01:02.000000', NULL, 0),
