(7300156, 1137696, 121111, '<td valign="top">=8-) <br/> <br/>Thank you for the comments, votes  and favorites<br/> <br/>Tough competition in this challenge, there are many images I really like, and that people may have gone though considerable effort to make them, I''m quite humbled <br/> <br/>This lake has given me two ribbons <br/> <br/>Thanks Bear for the clarification , earlier in the day, before dawn, it was  denser fog, the sky was not visible, then when the sun came out it was certainly mist.</td>', '=8-)  Thank you for the comments, votes  and favorites Tough competition in this challenge, there are many images I really like, and that people may have gone though considerable effort to make them, I''m quite humbled  This lake has given me two ribbons  Thanks Bear for the clarification , earlier in the day, before dawn, it was  denser fog, the sky was not visible, then when the sun came out it was certainly mist.', '2015-01-08 09:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
