(7300219, 1138061, 124815, '<td valign="top">Great shot Mark. And it had your signature all over. It was only 8 from me because I disliked the pushing of the processing in the background, both in saturation and sharpness. If I were you I would play more with this shot and keep it in the street album that I hope you''ll publish one day</td>', 'Great shot Mark. And it had your signature all over. It was only 8 from me because I disliked the pushing of the processing in the background, both in saturation and sharpness. If I were you I would play more with this shot and keep it in the street album that I hope you''ll publish one day', '2015-01-08 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
