(7300966, 1138056, 163430, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tph1:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice.  Hope you put some film in it and give it a bit of exersize. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There really is some film in the camera. I found that out by opening the back while showing my son hot the camera works :-)<br/> <br/>If i only knew where my film development equipment and chemicals are.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by tph1: Very nice.  Hope you put some film in it and give it a bit of exersize.   There really is some film in the camera. I found that out by opening the back while showing my son hot the camera works :-) If i only knew where my film development equipment and chemicals are. ', '2015-01-11 09:04:49.000000', NULL, 0),
